%% Mini Player 1 — Autoplay sequencial (RF-05, ADR-187)
%% Fluxo onEnded -> AudioSourceEngine -> AudioPlayerContext -> tryAutoplayNext
%% courseContext lido via useRef (evita stale closure no handler).

sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor U as User
    participant A as &lt;audio&gt; element<br/>(HTMLAudioElement)
    participant D as LibraryAudioDriver<br/>(IAudioSourceDriver)
    participant E as AudioSourceEngine<br/>(facade singleton)
    participant C as AudioPlayerContext<br/>(React state + useRef)
    participant Q as TanStack Query cache<br/>(GET /api/library/courses/:slug)
    participant T as Telemetry<br/>(POST /api/library/events)

    Note over U,T: Cenario: aula 1 do curso X terminando<br/>courseContext setado via LessonPicker ou Biblioteca

    A->>D: native 'ended' event
    D->>E: emit 'ended' (forward via .on listener)
    E->>C: forward 'ended' callback
    C->>C: tryAutoplayNext()
    C->>C: read courseContextRef.current<br/>(useRef evita stale closure)

    alt courseContext === null
        C->>C: setIsPlaying(false)
        Note right of C: D9 + Q5: stop silencioso<br/>(sem courseContext, sem auto)
    else nextIndex >= lessons.length
        C->>C: setIsPlaying(false)
        Note right of C: Fim do curso
    else next.hasAccess === false
        C->>C: setIsPlaying(false)
        Note right of C: Sem acesso (Q5)<br/>NAO pula pra index+2
    else success path
        C->>Q: courseContext.lessons[nextIndex]<br/>(ja em memoria, sem fetch)
        Q-->>C: next: AudioTrack
        C->>E: playTrack(next)
        E->>E: pickDriver(next.source)<br/>(activeDriver.source === 'library' -&gt; reuse)
        E->>D: load(next)
        D->>A: audioEl.src = next.audioUrl<br/>audioEl.load()
        E->>D: play()
        D->>A: audioEl.play()
        A-->>D: Promise&lt;void&gt; resolve
        D-->>E: ok
        E-->>C: ok
        C->>C: setActiveTrack(next)<br/>setCurrent(next)<br/>currentIndex = nextIndex<br/>setIsPlaying(true)
        C->>T: emit event 'next'<br/>source='mini_player'<br/>trigger='autoplay'<br/>(sendBeacon best-effort)
        Note over C,T: D13 + Q-G: telemetria via library_events<br/>(coluna metadata JSONB)
    end

    Note over U,T: Edge case: troca manual durante autoplay<br/>useRef garante leitura fresh do courseContext<br/>(mitiga race condition RF-05)
